Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:18:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] stock-ab: a command channel and an entity dump for
 side-by-side runs

SS_AB_DIR/cmd is run as console text once a frame; ab_ack, ab_view and
ab_dump_ents answer through files beside it. Inert without SS_AB_DIR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
